<title>ITALY: Italian mutual funds post Dec 9.18 trln inflow.</title>
<headline>Italian mutual funds post Dec 9.18 trln inflow.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian investment funds had a net inflow of 9.178 trillion lire in December, compared with a net inflow of 9.331 trillion lire in November, Assogestioni, the industry body said.  </p>
<p>				   December 1996     November 1996</p>
<p> Redemptions (bln lire)     6,408		  6,499</p>
<p> Subscriptions		 15,586		 15,830</p>
<p>Net inflow, outflow (-) from:</p>
<p> Equity funds		     369		   -216</p>
<p>     of which Italian	    75		    -28</p>
<p> Bond funds		     8,889		  9,714</p>
<p> Mixed funds			-80		   -167</p>
<p>-- Milan bureau +392 66129450</p>
</text>
